# Azaman — Visual Style & Design Tokens

Azaman uses an irreverent, minimalist UI vibe resembling a sticker-covered notebook on warm cream paper. It wears its young, orderly aesthetic proudly.

## Visual Metaphor
- **Page Canvas:** Warm light canvas background (`#f2f2f2`).
- **Heavy Outlines:** A heavy black hairline (`1px`) traces *every* surface—cards, phone frames, buttons, illustration stickers—giving the impression of printed stickers peeled onto a page.
- **Fills over Accents:** Muted brand colors are used as full-bleed card fills rather than thin accents.
- **No Drop Shadows:** Elevation is achieved through solid black borders and optional offset duplicate frames rather than soft gradients.

